ngError: ('42000', \"[42000] [Microsoft][ODBC Driver 17 for SQL Server][SQL Server]Incorrect syntax near '`'. (102) (SQLExecDirectW)\")\r\n```\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\nForeign key dropped alongside column without errors.\r\n\r\n**Versions.**\r\n - OS: Ubuntu 18.04\r\n - Python: 3.7.4\r\n - Alembic: 1.4.2\r\n - SQLAlchemy: 1.3.14\r\n - Database: Azure SQL Server\r\n - DBAPI: pyodbc==4.0.30\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/alembic/issues/716/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]